# Boost on 29's end save (AUTHORING.md, Boosts): party strength only, the story stays played.
# HP and PP refilled (party-level, the four moves set again).
# For TRAINER_LEADER_BYRON (MAGNETON 37, STEELIX 38, BASTIODON 41: Earthquake 4x/2x/4x) and the gym's trainers.
party-level 0 64
party-move 0 0 MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
party-move 0 1 MOVE_CRUNCH
party-move 0 2 MOVE_SEED_BOMB
party-move 0 3 MOVE_ROCK_SLIDE
